From 18e6d517b948a0bf3494aae81f428b3b741db448 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AxelGalvez11 <axelgalvez1121@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 9 Jul 2026 22:47:44 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?nemesis:=20round-6=20polish=20=E2=80=94=20live?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20captions,=20live-preview=20notes,=20pdf.js=20reader,=20sourc?=
 =?UTF-8?q?es=20rail?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Installer overlay: plain-English stage labels + softer copy (student build)
- Recorder: live on-device Whisper captions while recording (8s chunks, mix-bus
  tap, silence gate, backlog cap); transcript auto-saves as a Library note under
  Lectures; fixed analyser tap (MediaStreamDestination has no outputs)
- Library: NoteEditor with Obsidian-style live preview (heading sizes, hidden
  marks when unfocused, bullet dots, clickable wikilink pills w/ create-on-click)
- Library: pdf.js reader (legacy build — default build needs newer JS engine than
  Electron ships) with lazy page render, zoom, fit-width, dark chrome
- Study: New deck dialog, two-step deck delete, cards/list view toggle (persisted)
- Graph: ghost nodes for unresolved wikilinks, click creates the note, +New note
- Right sidebar: Sources tab (default for students) — evidence pills harvested
  from answers AND tool traffic (PubMed/FDA/trials/DOI), openFDA boilerplate
  filtered; Files tree one tab away
- deps: pdfjs-dist@5 (legacy), @codemirror/lang-markdown, @lezer/markdown
